# Frontend (HTMX + Alpine)

- Server-rendered HTML only. HTMX for partials, forms, and swaps. Alpine for local UI (dropdowns, modals, DnD) — post mutations with `hx-post` after client moves.
- Reuse `trigger_response` / `toast_response` from `apps/common/htmx.py` for `HX-Trigger` toasts and refresh events.
- Keep composer preview endpoints cheap (prefer no heavy DB work on debounce posts).
- Theming: change **brand tokens** in `theme/static_src/src/styles.css` (`--brand-*`). Semantic/component tokens reference brand tokens. Do not hardcode Ember hex in many places; do not revive Brightbean branding.
- Tailwind content scans templates under `templates/` and `apps/**/templates/`. No app JS bundler beyond Tailwind.
